title: "Lean-verified equilibrium existence for interest-free ownership economies"
abstract: "A machine-checked (Lean 4 / Mathlib) proof that an economy can run on ownership instead of interest: competitive equilibrium exists with no interest rate, time value comes from patience, and profit-share settlement is exact. 195 modules, 2113 audited results."
